Z||000002||FieroJoe||07-04-2001||10:42 PM||||I got my Fierostore floormats last week, and I love them!  They are very thick, and the embroidering on them looks great.  I got the grey ones, with "Fiero" embroidered in them.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
Z||000003||286SE'S||07-06-2001||03:33 PM||||I got a pair of floormats at JC Whitney that I have had for about 5 years. They are very good quality ones, cost about $59.00. No logos (there is already 8 logos on the seats, doors, map pockets, ext) The driver side has no worn spots at all and it does have the rubber patch area near the pedals. (I keep my factory mats stashed away) They <BR>are a light tan color and match my seats well.  Yeah, they get dirty but do fit in the washing machine and have been washed many times. Only problem was; When my heater core leaked it bleached out a few white spots on the pasenger side. I did not know antifreeze was a bleaching agent.<BR>I think floor mats are the only thing from JC Whitney that I have not had problems with.||||reg||1
Z||000004||artherd||07-07-2001||03:56 PM||||I'd just toss one more note in for the Fiero Store mats, they are top quality, and the fiero (or fiero GT) logo is embroidered&lt;sp&gt; in, meaning it's sewn in with thread, and it looks *great*<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
